    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77225" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰν-ᾰληθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>all true</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κακόμαντις Ἐρινύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					722
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					86
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			things, <i>absolutely true</i> or <i>real</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδονή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					583b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				4
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			).</div>
